Third-party assets included in this repository (MIT, from the
"DSH whale widget" project — https://github.com/MeteorNOX/DeepSeek-Balance-Whale-Widget):

  widget/assets/   (whale artwork & animations)
  sounds/presets/  (preset sound effects, EXCEPT minecraft-exp-orb.wav)
  docs/            (screenshots)

Exception: sounds/presets/minecraft-exp-orb.wav originates from the game
Minecraft and is NOT covered by the above MIT license, so it is not
distributed with this repository. The default configuration does not use it.
